    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the vehicle and traffic law, in relation to authorizing the\ndepartment of motor vehicles to accept certain documentation issued to\nveterans of the military as acceptable proofs of identity when applying for a\ndriver license or state identification card",
    "basePrintNo": "S9419",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S9419-2025",
